# Pull requests (this fork)

- **Target repo:** `sergey-zinchenko/vscode`, base branch **`main`**
- **Never** open PRs in `microsoft/vscode` from this workspace
- Push to **`origin`** (must be `sergey-zinchenko/vscode`), not `upstream`
- Always pass an explicit repo when using `gh` or GitHub MCP/API

```bash
git push -u origin HEAD
gh pr create --repo sergey-zinchenko/vscode --base main --title "..." --body "..."
```

After creation, verify the URL is `https://github.com/sergey-zinchenko/vscode/pull/...`.

See [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) and [FORK.md](../../FORK.md).
